WEBVTT

01:30.350 --> 01:34.950
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.210 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 29]

01:38.310 --> 01:40.039
Elders, you have to believe me.

01:40.039 --> 01:42.039
This is exactly what Hong Ye is like.

01:48.870 --> 01:50.070
My Lord has returned.

01:50.590 --> 01:52.280
My Lord, who has been working tirelessly
for the demons,

01:52.280 --> 01:53.539
has finally returned.

01:57.150 --> 01:57.950
This time,

01:59.280 --> 02:00.680
what sacred demon relic have you

02:00.680 --> 02:01.810
brought back for us?

02:01.920 --> 02:04.380
I don't need to report my whereabouts
to you.

02:04.950 --> 02:06.880
I'm asking on behalf of the elders.

02:07.560 --> 02:08.280
Rumors say

02:08.960 --> 02:11.020
you've been quite close with humans.

02:11.240 --> 02:12.080
You don't even care

02:12.080 --> 02:14.340
about demons being humiliated anymore.

02:14.520 --> 02:16.380
Where did these rumors come from?

02:16.430 --> 02:17.430
Whatever one does

02:17.800 --> 02:18.840
always leaves traces.

02:18.840 --> 02:19.730
Well said.

02:20.750 --> 02:22.950
Everything done leaves a trace behind.

02:23.030 --> 02:24.120
As the Demon Lord,

02:24.120 --> 02:25.960
I should indeed thoroughly investigate

02:25.960 --> 02:27.240
the rumors about you.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.200
Since you claim

02:34.360 --> 02:36.170
you're asking on behalf of the elders,

02:36.170 --> 02:37.290
then let the elders

02:37.750 --> 02:38.870
share their concerns

02:38.870 --> 02:40.579
directly with me.

02:40.870 --> 02:41.520
Hong Ye,

02:42.110 --> 02:43.890
we made you our Demon King

02:44.120 --> 02:45.720
to revitalize our demon kind

02:45.720 --> 02:47.680
and to resist human aggression.

02:47.840 --> 02:49.120
Don't lose your way.

02:49.430 --> 02:51.680
Heiwu has been working tirelessly

02:51.680 --> 02:53.400
to strengthen our demon forces.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.470
But you,

02:55.060 --> 02:57.000
every time you go to the human realm
seeking sacred demon relics,

02:57.000 --> 02:59.000
you face all sorts of difficulties.

02:59.000 --> 03:00.400
Since you're here today,

03:00.540 --> 03:02.400
you should first clarify

03:02.400 --> 03:03.430
your relationship with the humans.

03:03.430 --> 03:05.560
Otherwise,
if these rumors are proven true,

03:05.560 --> 03:06.870
we old fellows

03:06.870 --> 03:08.470
can no longer take your side.

03:13.930 --> 03:14.970
Elders,

03:16.280 --> 03:17.310
the grievances between our two races

03:17.310 --> 03:18.550
have existed for ages.

03:18.550 --> 03:20.680
But if demons truly want to find peace,

03:21.380 --> 03:23.440
we must understand how humans think.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.800
His Lordship is so powerful.

03:25.800 --> 03:28.000
How many years has he been cultivating?

03:28.560 --> 03:30.150
At least a thousand years.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.829
Four thousand years?

03:31.910 --> 03:33.440
Five or six thousand years?

03:33.590 --> 03:34.430
Anyway,

03:34.430 --> 03:35.630
it's not more than ten thousand years.

03:35.630 --> 03:37.000
I've never seen

03:37.000 --> 03:38.710
a demon who lived over ten thousand years.

03:38.710 --> 03:40.120
So you don't know either.

03:40.190 --> 03:40.650
What...

03:41.280 --> 03:41.740
What...

03:41.840 --> 03:43.310
are you talking about?

03:43.600 --> 03:44.550
Let me tell you,

03:44.750 --> 03:46.000
in the entire Demons' Valley,

03:46.000 --> 03:46.820
there's nothing about His Lordship

03:46.820 --> 03:47.980
that I don't know.

03:48.190 --> 03:49.030
Ask me anything.

03:49.030 --> 03:50.230
All right, all right.

03:50.579 --> 03:52.690
Then tell me what

03:52.840 --> 03:53.870
His Lordship's true form is.

03:53.870 --> 03:55.600
His Lordship's true form is...

03:57.150 --> 03:57.550
His...

03:58.840 --> 03:59.900
His Lordship's...

04:00.870 --> 04:03.070
What's His Lordship's true form again?

04:04.520 --> 04:06.400
Why are you sighing?

04:07.430 --> 04:08.990
It's not that I don't know.

04:09.080 --> 04:10.120
It's that, for this kind of thing,

04:10.120 --> 04:11.310
if His Lordship
doesn't mention it himself,

04:11.310 --> 04:13.310
it's not something we can ask about.

04:14.080 --> 04:15.280
But there's one thing

04:15.280 --> 04:16.140
I can guarantee

04:16.160 --> 04:17.339
is absolutely true.

04:17.430 --> 04:17.950
What?

04:21.269 --> 04:23.480
That His Lordship's power
used to be extremely weak—

04:23.480 --> 04:24.560
incredibly weak.

04:24.950 --> 04:26.310
But the previous Demon King

04:26.310 --> 04:27.750
admired His Lordship greatly.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.920
He said His Lordship

04:28.920 --> 04:30.690
was the most talented individual

04:30.690 --> 04:33.240
with the greatest potential
in the entire demon race.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.950
So before the old Demon King passed away,

04:34.950 --> 04:36.000
he left instructions

04:36.000 --> 04:37.390
specifically naming His Lordship

04:37.390 --> 04:39.000
as the new Demon King

04:39.000 --> 04:40.640
to protect the entire demon race.

04:40.640 --> 04:41.830
But because His Lordship's power

04:41.830 --> 04:43.120
was truly too weak,

04:43.120 --> 04:45.250
many great demons were not convinced.

04:45.750 --> 04:47.350
They said His Lordship was

04:47.390 --> 04:48.850
unworthy of the position.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.720
So to prove himself, His Lordship

04:50.720 --> 04:52.390
broke and rebuilt

04:52.390 --> 04:54.140
all the meridians in his body—

04:54.390 --> 04:55.650
he was at death's door.

04:55.950 --> 04:57.130
That's what made him

04:57.159 --> 05:00.290
the strongest and most powerful
great demon of our time.

05:01.010 --> 05:02.800
And as for His Lordship's identity,

05:02.800 --> 05:05.040
there are many theories
throughout the demon race.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.870
Do you know
what the most ridiculous one is?

05:06.870 --> 05:07.830
Some demons say

05:08.000 --> 05:09.190
that His Lordship

05:09.190 --> 05:11.400
sprang from some crack in a rock.

05:11.600 --> 05:13.130
How could that be possible?

05:14.000 --> 05:15.240
And others say

05:15.360 --> 05:17.750
that His Lordship is a descendant

05:17.750 --> 05:20.680
of the long-extinct ancient dragon clan.

05:21.600 --> 05:23.400
Actually, I think

05:23.720 --> 05:25.680
His Lordship himself isn't clear

05:25.680 --> 05:27.480
about what his true identity is.

05:27.760 --> 05:29.020
But it doesn't matter.

05:29.630 --> 05:30.600
No matter who he is

05:30.600 --> 05:31.560
or where he came from,

05:31.560 --> 05:32.750
it doesn't change the fact that

05:32.750 --> 05:34.480
he is now the most powerful demon
of our time.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.340
That's enough.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.750
He never mentioned any of this to me.

05:39.510 --> 05:40.920
That's normal.

05:41.360 --> 05:43.360
He has always been a man of few words.

05:43.360 --> 05:45.220
You'll get used to it eventually.

05:46.630 --> 05:47.240
But do you know

05:47.240 --> 05:48.630
what I've seen him do most often

05:48.630 --> 05:49.409
is?

05:50.830 --> 05:52.200
He'd just stand here,

05:52.750 --> 05:53.880
looking over there,

05:54.190 --> 05:55.420
at the moon,

05:55.840 --> 05:57.440
as if waiting for something,

05:57.560 --> 05:59.720
with a lonely expression.

06:00.870 --> 06:02.740
It always made my heart ache.

06:03.430 --> 06:05.690
Perhaps it's just as the old saying goes:

06:05.870 --> 06:07.190
the more powerful one's power is,

06:07.190 --> 06:08.750
the more one has to sacrifice,

06:08.750 --> 06:10.280
and the lonelier one feels.

06:14.070 --> 06:15.530
Have you ever seen him cry?

06:16.430 --> 06:18.190
Are you kidding?

06:18.190 --> 06:19.430
Why would the Demon King ever cry?

06:19.430 --> 06:20.360
I'm serious.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.750
I'm serious too!

06:21.870 --> 06:23.040
So what if he's the Demon King?

06:23.040 --> 06:24.580
Not even once?

06:27.000 --> 06:28.300
Actually, I think

06:28.330 --> 06:29.610
even if he does cry,

06:29.800 --> 06:31.510
he'd find a place where no one can see him

06:31.510 --> 06:32.630
and cry in secret.

06:33.000 --> 06:33.600
After all,

06:33.600 --> 06:34.730
he is the Demon King.

06:35.560 --> 06:36.510
So,

06:36.600 --> 06:37.320
since then,

06:37.360 --> 06:38.720
Xiao Mu and I decided

06:38.950 --> 06:40.159
we would stick with him,

06:40.159 --> 06:40.860
keep him company,

06:40.860 --> 06:41.950
stay by his side,

06:41.950 --> 06:43.159
and talk to him constantly—

06:43.159 --> 06:43.870
even if it's nonsense,

06:43.870 --> 06:45.330
we'd keep talking to him.

06:45.360 --> 06:46.870
Maybe in that moment

06:46.920 --> 06:49.100
he would feel less alone.

06:49.830 --> 06:51.070
After talking with you today,

06:51.070 --> 06:52.630
I want to be even better to him!

06:52.630 --> 06:53.800
-I want to be—
-You're already good enough to him.

06:53.800 --> 06:54.400
Not at all!

06:54.750 --> 06:55.750
More than enough.

06:56.070 --> 06:57.190
Is His Lordship coming back soon?

06:57.190 --> 06:58.590
Should we go welcome him?

06:58.870 --> 07:00.260
Oh right, I completely forgot about that,

07:00.260 --> 07:02.060
chatting with you all this time.

07:02.750 --> 07:04.720
I'm afraid you'll talk
His Lordship to death.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.430
Humans,

07:06.240 --> 07:07.440
out of fear of demons,

07:08.210 --> 07:10.070
slaughter demons.

07:10.440 --> 07:12.120
Demons, hating humans,

07:12.840 --> 07:14.270
eat humans.

07:15.620 --> 07:16.940
It's a vicious cycle—

07:17.400 --> 07:18.660
difficult to break.

07:19.230 --> 07:21.140
The best solution now

07:21.700 --> 07:23.220
is for both races

07:23.480 --> 07:24.760
to cease fighting

07:24.930 --> 07:26.330
and coexist peacefully.

07:26.870 --> 07:29.200
His Lordship always comes and goes alone,

07:29.510 --> 07:31.370
but he's different only with you.

07:31.720 --> 07:32.800
Not only does he protect you,

07:32.800 --> 07:34.310
he also smiles at you often.

07:34.310 --> 07:35.630
In that brief moment just now—

07:35.630 --> 07:36.700
I counted—

07:36.730 --> 07:38.550
he smiled at you four times.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.040
That's more than he's smiled

07:40.040 --> 07:41.370
at me in the entire year.

07:41.890 --> 07:42.890
Tell me honestly.

07:43.310 --> 07:44.720
Who are you really?

07:47.190 --> 07:48.850
Perhaps because I'm new here,

07:48.920 --> 07:51.050
His Lordship is just looking after me.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.360
Let me tell you,

07:57.750 --> 07:59.130
in Demons' Valley,

07:59.310 --> 08:00.120
the most important person

08:00.120 --> 08:01.270
to listen to is His Lordship.

08:01.270 --> 08:01.920
After that,

08:01.920 --> 08:02.830
it's Xiao Mu

08:03.040 --> 08:04.160
and me.

08:04.870 --> 08:05.270
You...

08:06.830 --> 08:07.960
Where are you going?

08:08.720 --> 08:09.480
Go that way.

08:10.280 --> 08:11.880
Where does this path lead to?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.090
It leads to the prison.

08:14.090 --> 08:15.190
Nothing worth seeing there.

08:15.190 --> 08:16.040
Prison?

08:17.990 --> 08:19.450
The Demons' Valley a hundred years later

08:19.450 --> 08:21.180
doesn't have a place like this.

08:21.180 --> 08:22.580
Who do they keep in there?

08:23.040 --> 08:23.870
Seriously?

08:24.600 --> 08:26.460
Human prisons hold demons;

08:26.560 --> 08:29.420
naturally, demon prisons hold humans.

08:29.920 --> 08:31.450
What are they captured for?

08:33.030 --> 08:34.000
What do you think

08:34.200 --> 08:35.330
we do to them?

08:42.299 --> 08:43.830
Have you ever eaten a human?

08:44.720 --> 08:45.510
No.

08:46.320 --> 08:48.390
I heard human flesh isn't tasty.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.840
It's dry and tough,

08:50.770 --> 08:52.700
nowhere near as good as dried fish.

08:54.150 --> 08:55.350
Who would eat humans?

08:58.240 --> 09:00.750
Humans are reserved
for the great demons and elders—

09:00.750 --> 09:02.280
never for somebody like me.

09:07.030 --> 09:07.630
What are you doing?

09:07.630 --> 09:09.150
I told you there's nothing to see.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.210
What are you doing?

09:16.070 --> 09:17.030
Help!

09:17.030 --> 09:18.750
Save me!

09:18.870 --> 09:20.630
-Help!
-Save me!

09:20.630 --> 09:21.790
Help!

09:21.870 --> 09:22.840
Help me!

09:22.840 --> 09:24.120
Save me!

09:24.360 --> 09:25.510
Help me!

09:25.630 --> 09:27.720
-Help!
-Save me!

09:27.840 --> 09:29.790
-Save me.
-You can't eat this.

09:30.040 --> 09:31.570
They are for the sacrifice.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.360
Please save me!

09:34.790 --> 09:35.440
I beg you—

09:35.600 --> 09:37.120
I beg you, immortal demon lord,

09:37.120 --> 09:39.320
-please spare my life.
-Stop shouting.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.170
My Lord,

09:52.670 --> 09:54.260
I'm just

09:54.630 --> 09:56.490
a city guard from the human realm.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.340
I know my mistake

09:57.340 --> 09:58.910
of accidentally disturbing

09:58.910 --> 09:59.910
your meditation.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.400
I beg you, My Lord,

10:01.420 --> 10:02.200
spare me.

10:02.410 --> 10:04.720
I have a family to support!

10:04.740 --> 10:05.650
Let me tell you,

10:06.060 --> 10:07.870
no human who enters Demons' Valley

10:07.870 --> 10:10.040
leaves alive.

10:15.040 --> 10:17.150
I swear to heaven!

10:17.550 --> 10:19.870
I will never reveal anything

10:19.890 --> 10:21.890
about what happened in this valley.

10:22.440 --> 10:23.900
If you don't believe me, My Lord,

10:23.900 --> 10:24.560
I am willing

10:24.670 --> 10:25.730
to gouge out my eyes

10:26.030 --> 10:27.290
and bite off my tongue.

10:27.330 --> 10:28.870
-Save me!
-I beg you, My Lord,

10:28.870 --> 10:30.230
spare my life.

10:30.270 --> 10:30.790
Enough.

10:31.070 --> 10:32.670
Stop your senseless crying.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.340
That's enough.

10:35.390 --> 10:36.270
You've seen enough.

10:36.270 --> 10:37.790
We need to go welcome His Lordship.

10:37.790 --> 10:38.430
Let's go.

10:41.550 --> 10:42.320
Princess.

10:44.390 --> 10:45.590
Stop looking.

10:45.630 --> 10:46.910
Let's hurry.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.960
His Lordship, don't leave!

10:50.000 --> 10:52.240
Don't go, His Lordship!

10:54.380 --> 10:56.480
Those children are only 6 or 7 years old.

10:56.480 --> 10:59.080
Why won't they spare
even such young children?

10:59.840 --> 11:01.620
Humans may have short lives,

11:01.840 --> 11:03.120
but they grow up fast.

11:03.270 --> 11:04.470
In just over 10 years,

11:04.510 --> 11:05.870
they can reach adulthood.

11:05.870 --> 11:07.020
Unlike us demons,

11:07.080 --> 11:08.750
who need at least
several hundred years of cultivation

11:08.750 --> 11:10.550
just to barely transform into human form.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.600
Do you know how much
it took for Xiao Mu and me

11:12.600 --> 11:13.930
to take this human form?

11:19.320 --> 11:20.320
Hong Ye

11:21.840 --> 11:23.840
hasn't eaten humans before, right?

11:25.440 --> 11:26.120
What?

11:28.480 --> 11:29.080
Hong Ye.

11:29.080 --> 11:29.810
How dare you!

11:32.030 --> 11:34.560
How dare you address
His Lordship by his name?

11:37.200 --> 11:38.770
Has he or has he not?

11:39.240 --> 11:40.030
I don't know.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.720
Though I haven't seen it myself,

11:41.720 --> 11:42.790
but think about it:

11:43.240 --> 11:45.030
His Lordship has been in this world
for thousands of years.

11:45.030 --> 11:46.030
What hasn't he seen?

11:46.030 --> 11:47.230
What hasn't he eaten?

11:47.830 --> 11:49.290
Eating a human

11:49.750 --> 11:51.030
is nothing strange.

11:52.790 --> 11:53.750
You go ahead first.

11:53.750 --> 11:55.010
I'll come along later.

11:55.530 --> 11:56.660
Where are you going?

11:56.750 --> 11:59.280
His Lordship told me
to keep a close eye on you.

12:01.530 --> 12:02.660
His Lordship told me

12:03.030 --> 12:04.360
to take good care of you.

12:04.550 --> 12:06.080
I need to relieve myself now.

12:06.080 --> 12:06.670
You staying right here

12:06.670 --> 12:07.720
and waiting for me to return

12:07.720 --> 12:09.750
would be the best care you could provide.

12:09.750 --> 12:10.680
Don't follow me.

12:12.840 --> 12:14.570
I don't even want to follow you.

12:14.870 --> 12:15.510
Hurry up.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.550
Elders, look at this.

12:17.960 --> 12:19.220
This is our Demon King,

12:19.320 --> 12:20.670
a king who sympathizes with humans

12:20.670 --> 12:22.870
and speaks for humans at every turn.

12:23.020 --> 12:23.710
Do you think

12:24.200 --> 12:25.320
he still deserves

12:25.320 --> 12:26.790
to sit on the Demon King's throne?

12:26.790 --> 12:28.960
The survival of our demon race
is a long-term strategy,

12:28.960 --> 12:30.690
not something as shortsighted

12:31.320 --> 12:32.480
as you perceive it.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.810
I'm shortsighted?

12:34.670 --> 12:35.910
Me?

12:37.120 --> 12:39.850
Only absolute suppression
can bring true peace!

12:42.270 --> 12:42.790
Hmm.

12:44.220 --> 12:45.220
Our demon race

12:45.250 --> 12:47.510
has suffered humiliation from humans
for thousands of years.

12:47.510 --> 12:48.200
As the Demon King,

12:48.200 --> 12:49.510
instead of thinking about revenge,

12:49.510 --> 12:50.970
you stand with the humans.

12:51.750 --> 12:52.950
Elders, look at this.

12:53.670 --> 12:55.210
Hong Ye's words today

12:55.630 --> 12:57.960
aren't thoughts formed in just a few days.

12:58.740 --> 12:59.510
He must have

13:00.150 --> 13:02.950
harbored treacherous intentions
for a long time.

13:06.480 --> 13:07.150
Hong Ye,

13:08.480 --> 13:09.740
trusting human nature

13:09.960 --> 13:12.020
will lead to irreversible disaster.

13:12.150 --> 13:12.670
Hong Ye,

13:13.480 --> 13:14.360
do you know

13:15.120 --> 13:17.120
your getting too close
to the humans

13:17.840 --> 13:19.600
was told to us by a human?

13:23.750 --> 13:24.600
Wu Huan!

13:26.120 --> 13:27.580
Bring them here!

13:27.960 --> 13:31.790
-Sister, please help me.
-Please save me.

13:31.790 --> 13:32.520
Don't speak.

13:34.720 --> 13:36.150
I will take you out of here.

13:36.150 --> 13:36.790
Hurry.

13:37.120 --> 13:37.720
Follow me.

13:37.920 --> 13:38.560
Hold hands.

13:38.560 --> 13:39.160
Princess,

13:39.720 --> 13:41.150
please spare my life too.

13:42.790 --> 13:43.790
Earlier in the palace,

13:43.790 --> 13:44.890
I've offended you many times,

13:44.890 --> 13:46.540
but that was just my duty.

13:46.840 --> 13:48.390
I never meant to offend you, Princess.

13:48.390 --> 13:49.850
You've already hit me too.

13:50.200 --> 13:50.940
I only beg you, Princess,

13:50.940 --> 13:51.960
to spare my life.

13:52.150 --> 13:52.960
I promise

13:53.000 --> 13:53.910
to take these three children

13:53.910 --> 13:54.910
safely back home.

13:55.520 --> 13:56.790
About what happened in this valley,

13:56.790 --> 13:57.820
I won't say a word.

13:58.550 --> 13:59.970
I will forever be grateful for your

13:59.970 --> 14:01.430
great kindness and mercy.

14:01.540 --> 14:02.540
Please give me a chance

14:02.540 --> 14:04.430
to redeem myself.

14:05.910 --> 14:06.840
You liar.

14:07.710 --> 14:09.210
You're helping humans?

14:10.040 --> 14:10.640
Princess,

14:10.850 --> 14:11.570
let me go!

14:11.720 --> 14:13.780
I'll protect you from this cat demon.

14:15.640 --> 14:16.350
You're

14:16.930 --> 14:18.140
a human princess?

14:19.900 --> 14:20.430
Yes.

14:20.800 --> 14:22.000
I am a human princess,

14:22.390 --> 14:24.050
but I'm also Hong Ye's friend.

14:24.250 --> 14:25.600
You've been deceiving His Lordship!

14:25.600 --> 14:26.750
I haven't deceived anyone.

14:26.750 --> 14:27.910
Hong Ye has great powers.

14:27.910 --> 14:29.300
How could I possibly deceive him?

14:29.300 --> 14:30.540
He brought me here

14:30.570 --> 14:32.320
so that humans and demons

14:32.320 --> 14:33.480
could understand each other better.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.360
He's seeking

14:34.440 --> 14:35.700
a way for coexistence.

14:35.910 --> 14:36.670
You're talking nonsense!

14:36.670 --> 14:37.360
How is that possible?

14:37.360 --> 14:38.150
Why not?

14:38.570 --> 14:40.970
Must we fight
and kill each other every day?

14:41.360 --> 14:42.440
The princess is right.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.390
Humans and demons coexisting

14:43.390 --> 14:44.270
is the right way!

14:44.270 --> 14:44.990
Shut up.

14:45.390 --> 14:46.270
If you don't believe me,

14:46.270 --> 14:47.330
you can ask Hong Ye.

14:48.120 --> 14:48.440
I...

14:49.120 --> 14:49.550
I...

14:50.880 --> 14:52.740
I can't just take your word for it.

14:52.900 --> 14:54.290
If you want to free the humans,

14:54.290 --> 14:55.310
it must be His Lordship

14:55.310 --> 14:56.510
who says so in person.

14:59.000 --> 14:59.480
Oh no.

14:59.790 --> 15:00.790
Wu Huan is coming.

15:01.000 --> 15:02.930
He must be here for the sacrifices.

15:03.830 --> 15:04.430
Princess.

15:04.500 --> 15:05.610
Save me, Princess!

15:05.770 --> 15:06.850
Save me, Princess!

15:07.080 --> 15:07.750
Quick!

15:07.780 --> 15:09.240
Please save me, Princess!

15:09.260 --> 15:10.790
Save me, Princess, please!

15:10.800 --> 15:11.710
Help me!

15:13.600 --> 15:14.200
Quick,

15:14.480 --> 15:15.870
take them to those bushes over there

15:15.870 --> 15:16.690
and hide them.

15:16.790 --> 15:17.850
I'll deal with him.

15:18.790 --> 15:19.630
Go now!

15:20.480 --> 15:21.010
Let's go.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.040
Come on, move!

15:22.960 --> 15:23.490
Ning'an.

15:26.240 --> 15:27.590
I've never seen His Lordship

15:27.590 --> 15:29.030
as happy as today.

15:29.720 --> 15:30.390
Remember,

15:31.010 --> 15:32.810
don't disappoint His Lordship.

15:33.930 --> 15:34.700
Go!

15:42.910 --> 15:44.110
Where are the humans?

15:44.440 --> 15:45.040
I ate them.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.670
Three small ones and one big one—

15:48.670 --> 15:49.670
you ate them all?

15:49.960 --> 15:50.440
Yes.

15:51.320 --> 15:53.080
Those three small ones were quite tender,

15:53.080 --> 15:53.910
but the big one wasn't good.

15:53.910 --> 15:54.670
He's too tough,

15:54.670 --> 15:55.320
and fatty.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.720
Do you know who they were?

15:57.600 --> 15:59.080
The big one was the Feiyu Guard leader.

15:59.080 --> 16:01.000
We needed him alive for questioning.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.270
Those three small ones were sacrifices

16:02.270 --> 16:03.240
for the ancestral ceremony
on the first day.

16:03.240 --> 16:04.520
And you just ate them?

16:04.750 --> 16:05.240
Look.

16:05.910 --> 16:07.170
You're getting upset.

16:07.630 --> 16:09.120
You didn't put up any signs here.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.580
How was I supposed to know?

16:13.890 --> 16:16.550
Don't you usually only eat
rotten fish, prawns,

16:16.630 --> 16:18.030
grasshoppers, and rats?

16:18.600 --> 16:20.310
Since when did you start eating humans?

16:20.310 --> 16:21.370
Don't mention it.

16:21.510 --> 16:22.720
The weather's been bad these days.

16:22.720 --> 16:24.260
My dried fish isn't ready yet.

16:24.260 --> 16:25.450
I was starving,

16:25.510 --> 16:26.790
so I had to eat them.

16:27.910 --> 16:28.570
Fine.

16:28.840 --> 16:30.480
Since you admit you ate them,

16:30.550 --> 16:31.910
come back with me to Youning Cave

16:31.910 --> 16:33.370
to explain to the elders.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.950
Take your claws off me.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.750
You ate them?

16:42.960 --> 16:45.820
The human Feiyu Guard
I worked so hard to capture

16:45.870 --> 16:47.290
admitted himself

16:48.480 --> 16:51.360
that Demon King is secretly colluding
with the human royal family.

16:51.360 --> 16:53.960
I came to confront the Demon King
with this person,

16:53.960 --> 16:55.360
and the next thing I know,

16:56.240 --> 16:57.630
you've eaten him?

17:04.200 --> 17:05.400
I believe it.

17:05.550 --> 17:07.150
But do the elders believe it?

17:10.400 --> 17:11.859
Why did you eat the humans?

17:13.640 --> 17:14.369
I was hungry.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.480
You were hungry?

17:15.750 --> 17:17.210
The elders are hungry too.

17:17.240 --> 17:18.680
What he ate were sacrifices.

17:18.680 --> 17:20.829
This is a serious crime.
He should be punished.

17:20.829 --> 17:21.920
You did that too?

17:22.270 --> 17:22.790
Yes.

17:23.480 --> 17:25.200
I wasn't satisfied with just one,

17:25.200 --> 17:26.599
so I ate all three of them.

17:27.030 --> 17:29.030
You ate them all in such a short time?

17:29.110 --> 17:30.310
Weren't there other demons

17:30.310 --> 17:31.440
sharing with you?

17:31.440 --> 17:33.640
Why should I share with other demons?

17:35.350 --> 17:35.790
Well.

17:37.030 --> 17:37.630
Very well.

17:38.030 --> 17:39.160
Given what you said,

17:39.590 --> 17:40.720
stealing offerings

17:41.070 --> 17:42.160
deserves

17:43.640 --> 17:45.300
the punishment of lightning.

17:45.920 --> 17:46.510
Fine.

17:47.480 --> 17:48.880
Xiao Ming caused trouble

17:49.440 --> 17:51.550
because I didn't discipline him properly.

17:51.550 --> 17:53.200
I'll take the punishment for him.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.170
No, no!

17:54.310 --> 17:54.840
Silence!

17:56.960 --> 17:58.960
Even if the cat stole the offerings,

17:59.720 --> 18:00.850
we're punishing him

18:00.920 --> 18:02.920
because he overstepped his bounds.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.260
How could we punish

18:04.440 --> 18:05.770
the Demon King instead?

18:07.030 --> 18:08.300
But what if

18:08.480 --> 18:11.270
the Demon King ordered his subordinate
to silence others,

18:11.270 --> 18:12.870
who should be punished then?

18:13.550 --> 18:15.310
Without solid evidence,

18:16.000 --> 18:16.680
we

18:16.680 --> 18:18.880
should not make baseless accusations.

18:20.200 --> 18:20.880
Recently,

18:21.680 --> 18:24.480
the human Feiyu Guard
has repeatedly invaded Demons' Valley,

18:24.480 --> 18:27.010
and many demons
have suffered at their hands.

18:27.350 --> 18:28.070
Hong Ye,

18:29.000 --> 18:30.410
as the Demon King,

18:30.640 --> 18:32.720
you've failed to protect the residents
of Demons' Valley,

18:32.720 --> 18:35.320
yet you constantly speak
in favor of humans.

18:36.750 --> 18:38.790
That human has been captured by me
for days,

18:38.790 --> 18:40.400
as all the elders know.

18:41.750 --> 18:42.440
This cat

18:42.880 --> 18:44.870
normally eats fish and mice,

18:44.920 --> 18:47.440
but today he swallowed
so many living humans.

18:47.440 --> 18:48.070
Tell me,

18:49.680 --> 18:51.740
without orders from you, his master,

18:52.200 --> 18:53.930
would he dare to do such a thing?

18:54.290 --> 18:55.200
Heiwu.

18:55.680 --> 18:56.680
You needn't go to such lengths

18:56.680 --> 18:58.480
to fabricate crimes against me.

18:59.160 --> 19:01.170
Today I'll fulfill your wish.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.170
If punishment is required,

19:04.960 --> 19:05.620
I accept it.

19:05.830 --> 19:06.440
Good.

19:07.160 --> 19:09.020
The cat is Hong Ye's trusted aide.

19:09.200 --> 19:10.440
Whether it's poor supervision

19:10.440 --> 19:11.840
or secret instructions,

19:11.920 --> 19:13.050
stealing offerings

19:13.480 --> 19:15.340
makes his punishment justified.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.440
Elders,

19:17.110 --> 19:17.830
please

19:18.960 --> 19:21.290
cast the lightning spell for punishment.

19:34.880 --> 19:35.720
Come.

19:40.750 --> 19:41.680
Swear to heaven.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.370
I, Wang Hong,

19:46.200 --> 19:47.200
swear to heaven

19:48.550 --> 19:49.880
that upon leaving Demons' Valley,

19:49.880 --> 19:51.270
I will definitely
take these three children

19:51.270 --> 19:52.800
safely back to their families.

19:52.800 --> 19:55.110
As everything I've seen and heard
in this valley,

19:55.110 --> 19:56.040
I won't say a word

19:56.400 --> 19:57.790
after leaving this place.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.310
No.

19:59.350 --> 20:00.640
I want you, after you return,

20:00.640 --> 20:02.520
to tell my father everything you've seen

20:02.520 --> 20:03.790
and experienced.

20:04.310 --> 20:05.920
Tell him that demons are like humans,

20:05.920 --> 20:07.780
there are good and bad among them.

20:07.790 --> 20:08.990
Say that I hope Father

20:09.000 --> 20:10.820
can be kind and benevolent

20:10.920 --> 20:12.640
to reconcile and coexist
with the demons.

20:12.640 --> 20:13.370
To reconcile

20:13.440 --> 20:14.070
and coexist

20:14.070 --> 20:15.180
with the demons.

20:15.720 --> 20:17.010
If this oath is broken,

20:17.400 --> 20:19.730
heaven's punishment will surely follow.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.270
Oh, no.

20:24.270 --> 20:26.760
I, Wang Hong,
will definitely keep my oath!

20:28.400 --> 20:29.200
My Lord!

20:30.400 --> 20:31.240
My Lord!

20:31.920 --> 20:33.110
Let me go!

20:33.640 --> 20:34.200
My Lord.

20:41.480 --> 20:42.310
My Lord.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.550
My Lord!

20:57.310 --> 20:58.080
No...

20:58.180 --> 20:58.830
No!

20:59.510 --> 21:00.200
Stop!

21:03.400 --> 21:05.120
This has nothing to do with His Lordship!

21:05.120 --> 21:06.500
I ate the offering!

21:32.310 --> 21:33.870
My Lord!

21:46.110 --> 21:46.830
My Lord.

21:47.840 --> 21:48.770
My Lord.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.140
It's not a big deal.

22:06.140 --> 22:07.600
Why are you crying so much?

22:09.590 --> 22:11.000
I have my power to protect me.

22:11.000 --> 22:11.570
I'm fine.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.290
My Lord,

22:13.440 --> 22:15.930
Heiwu clearly wanted to kill you.

22:16.820 --> 22:18.290
If it had been me instead,

22:18.640 --> 22:20.900
I would have been destroyed completely.

22:21.000 --> 22:22.000
Where is Ning'an?

22:24.250 --> 22:25.620
Where are those humans?

22:27.720 --> 22:28.650
Tell me quickly.

22:28.880 --> 22:29.920
My Lord,

22:29.960 --> 22:31.960
don't trust the human race too much.

22:32.070 --> 22:32.640
They...

22:36.440 --> 22:37.170
Hong Ye.

22:38.720 --> 22:39.250
Ning'an.

22:40.300 --> 22:41.290
Does it hurt?

22:42.720 --> 22:43.420
I'm fine.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.970
You released those humans?

22:52.510 --> 22:54.080
They're just children.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.090
You're lying!

22:55.350 --> 22:57.410
-She let the Feiyu Guard go—
-Shut up.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.270
Just tell me

23:03.950 --> 23:05.170
where they are.

23:07.000 --> 23:08.730
I just want to ask you one thing.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.680
Answer me honestly.

23:13.580 --> 23:15.840
Have you ever eaten humans?

23:24.730 --> 23:26.990
I've fought against humans
for thousands of years,

23:26.990 --> 23:28.720
and indeed many human warriors

23:28.730 --> 23:29.530
and sorcerers

23:29.580 --> 23:30.710
have died by my hand.

23:31.000 --> 23:33.430
But something as tasteless and vile
as eating humans

23:33.430 --> 23:35.090
is something I've never done.

23:38.240 --> 23:38.870
Mm-hmm.

23:39.720 --> 23:40.980
I believe what you say.

23:41.590 --> 23:43.020
Those children and the Feiyu Guard,

23:43.020 --> 23:44.950
I've hidden them at Chenxiang Sea.

23:45.090 --> 23:46.680
Whether to release them or keep them—

23:46.680 --> 23:48.410
I wanted to discuss it with you.

23:49.390 --> 23:50.180
My Lord,

23:50.720 --> 23:51.550
you absolutely cannot let humans

23:51.550 --> 23:53.270
know the secrets of Demons' Valley.

23:53.270 --> 23:54.110
If that happens,

23:54.110 --> 23:55.830
they might plunder our treasures,

23:55.830 --> 23:57.520
and at worst,
countless lives might be lost.

23:57.520 --> 23:58.880
For self-preservation,

23:58.880 --> 24:00.790
demons would have to migrate elsewhere
to survive.

24:00.790 --> 24:02.190
Please think carefully!

24:08.070 --> 24:08.680
Jump down.

24:21.200 --> 24:21.920
Jump.

24:25.350 --> 24:26.190
Demon King,

24:26.750 --> 24:27.950
Your Highness,

24:28.190 --> 24:30.300
I have already sworn an oath.

24:30.750 --> 24:32.920
Please spare my life.

24:37.510 --> 24:38.830
Return to the human realm

24:38.830 --> 24:40.090
and keep your promise.

24:46.730 --> 24:47.950
Children, come here.

24:52.200 --> 24:53.580
Hug your shoulders

24:53.920 --> 24:55.240
like me.

24:56.350 --> 24:57.310
Close your eyes.

24:58.030 --> 25:00.870
Count from 1 to 10 silently,

25:00.930 --> 25:02.950
and then you can open your eyes.

25:28.360 --> 25:29.360
My Lord,

25:29.550 --> 25:30.720
the future of our demon race

25:30.720 --> 25:32.470
now depends entirely on the humans.

25:32.470 --> 25:34.200
It's far too dangerous.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.640
If disaster strikes,

25:36.110 --> 25:37.910
we'll all be beyond redemption.

25:41.160 --> 25:43.160
I must return to the human realm now.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.640
I'll meet with my father.

25:44.910 --> 25:45.840
I'll tell him

25:46.400 --> 25:48.180
that the Demon King
has chosen to trust humans,

25:48.180 --> 25:50.000
to temporarily cease hostilities.

25:50.000 --> 25:52.350
It's now on humans to decide
how we should respond.

25:52.350 --> 25:52.950
Very well.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.030
I'll escort you back.

25:57.590 --> 25:58.160
My Lord.

25:59.200 --> 26:00.400
What if Ning'an

26:00.400 --> 26:01.930
doesn't return after this?

26:03.480 --> 26:04.680
Ning'an will return.

26:04.880 --> 26:05.240
I...

26:08.100 --> 26:08.510
You...

26:09.390 --> 26:10.640
You never listen to anything I say.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.550
I give up!

26:11.960 --> 26:12.640
Seriously!

26:17.240 --> 26:19.570
What if my father detains me

26:19.610 --> 26:20.800
and I can't escape?

26:21.240 --> 26:22.700
Then I'll come rescue you.

26:23.830 --> 26:24.600
What if I

26:25.000 --> 26:26.680
am no longer in this world?

26:28.600 --> 26:30.210
Why are you suddenly asking this?

26:30.210 --> 26:31.270
I just want to know.

26:32.150 --> 26:32.750
What if I

26:33.090 --> 26:33.980
die?

26:35.290 --> 26:37.290
Then I'll find you in your next life.

26:43.640 --> 26:44.380
Hong Ye.

26:45.350 --> 26:46.310
Promise me,

26:47.110 --> 26:47.880
if,

26:48.480 --> 26:50.000
when you find me again,

26:50.640 --> 26:51.590
I have changed,

26:52.880 --> 26:54.350
you and Princess Ning'an

26:56.370 --> 26:57.680
will just be friends.

26:58.600 --> 26:59.800
Just be friends.

27:00.920 --> 27:01.920
Will you promise?

27:03.670 --> 27:04.240
No.

27:05.860 --> 27:06.630
Why not?

27:07.310 --> 27:08.480
Because I love you.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.790
Perhaps it's because of your kindness,

27:17.110 --> 27:17.840
your purity,

27:18.480 --> 27:19.510
and your loyalty.

27:20.050 --> 27:22.580
You showed me
a different kind of human realm.

27:22.890 --> 27:23.920
You also allowed me to see

27:23.920 --> 27:25.330
the future of our two races

27:25.330 --> 27:27.060
I've never envisioned before.

27:27.160 --> 27:28.670
But all of this is because

27:29.640 --> 27:30.160
you

27:31.820 --> 27:32.490
are you.

27:38.200 --> 27:40.550
You've never spoken like this before.

27:40.870 --> 27:41.860
Of course not.

27:42.960 --> 27:45.090
I've never said such things to anyone.

27:45.350 --> 27:46.380
You're the first

27:48.310 --> 27:49.680
and will be the only one.

27:54.240 --> 27:54.960
What if I

27:57.810 --> 27:59.340
weren't Princess Ning'an?

28:03.590 --> 28:04.720
I like you.

28:05.310 --> 28:06.840
No matter what your name is,

28:07.160 --> 28:08.550
what your status is,

28:08.690 --> 28:10.390
whether you're human or spirit,

28:10.390 --> 28:11.810
it doesn't matter.

28:14.350 --> 28:15.350
I just don't know

28:17.780 --> 28:19.110
if you feel the same way.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.160
I do.

28:44.030 --> 28:45.500
Coming back here,

28:46.020 --> 28:47.820
it feels like it'd been forever.

28:48.000 --> 28:49.000
Go back to your palace first

28:49.000 --> 28:50.300
and get some good rest.

28:50.920 --> 28:52.140
Whatever happens,

28:52.640 --> 28:53.880
I'll face it with you.

28:57.080 --> 28:59.790
Then I want you to stay with me
until I fall asleep.

28:59.790 --> 29:01.120
Leave after I'm asleep.

29:03.920 --> 29:04.520
All right.

29:27.480 --> 29:28.140
Don't move.

29:51.750 --> 29:53.160
It's a small trick.

30:01.790 --> 30:04.120
Your Majesty,
Princess Ning'an has returned.

30:04.120 --> 30:06.780
She entered Yong'an Palace
with the Demon King.

30:08.140 --> 30:10.400
She really came back with the Demon King.

30:10.480 --> 30:11.780
It's absolutely true.

30:11.810 --> 30:13.800
They've entered the array set
by the Feiyu Guard.

30:13.800 --> 30:14.550
By now,

30:14.550 --> 30:16.410
they should be fighting already.

30:24.070 --> 30:28.640
[Yong'an Palace]

30:29.440 --> 30:30.770
It's you.

30:30.850 --> 30:33.410
I thank Your Highness for saving my life.

30:34.160 --> 30:35.170
After we kill the Demon King,

30:35.170 --> 30:36.550
I will certainly report to His Majesty

30:36.550 --> 30:39.270
that you led the Demon King into our trap.

30:39.350 --> 30:40.730
You're full of lies!

30:41.560 --> 30:43.540
I told you to tell my father the truth.

30:43.540 --> 30:45.090
What did you say?

30:45.280 --> 30:46.860
I reported truthfully.

30:47.270 --> 30:48.530
I was simply careless

30:48.890 --> 30:51.350
and fell into the trap
of the cunning demons.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.800
Fortunately, the princess saved me

30:52.800 --> 30:54.200
and I escaped with my life.

30:54.200 --> 30:54.750
Therefore,

30:54.750 --> 30:55.990
all the more we should kill the Demon King

30:55.990 --> 30:57.120
to redeem ourselves

30:57.240 --> 30:58.400
and serve the royal family.

30:58.400 --> 31:00.000
Hong Ye suffered lightning punishment

31:00.000 --> 31:01.350
to save you.

31:01.720 --> 31:03.390
How dare you be so ungrateful.

31:03.790 --> 31:04.960
The princess just said

31:04.960 --> 31:05.440
Hong Ye

31:05.970 --> 31:07.510
has just endured lightning punishment

31:07.510 --> 31:09.480
and his power is greatly diminished.

31:09.480 --> 31:11.080
Feiyu Guard, hear my orders!

31:11.240 --> 31:12.940
Whoever wounds Demon King Hong Ye

31:12.940 --> 31:13.860
will be rewarded with gold.

31:13.860 --> 31:15.060
Whoever kills Hong Ye

31:15.160 --> 31:16.110
will be granted a title!

31:16.110 --> 31:17.240
Activate the array!

31:23.030 --> 31:24.950
I was going to let you all go,

31:26.070 --> 31:28.690
but now I really want you dead.

31:31.570 --> 31:33.230
I'm carrying Hong Ye's child.

31:33.590 --> 31:34.450
If you kill him,

31:34.550 --> 31:35.810
you're killing me too.

31:39.070 --> 31:40.450
Feiyu Guards, you've all heard it.

31:40.070 --> 31:42.300
[Yong'an Palace]

31:40.550 --> 31:42.350
The princess is entangled with demons

31:42.350 --> 31:43.550
and blinded by demonic arts.

31:43.550 --> 31:45.400
Now she's carrying a demon spawn.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.860
If the princess is harmed,

31:46.880 --> 31:49.480
it's considered loyalty
in capturing demons.

32:01.440 --> 32:03.230
Who dares to touch her?

32:03.350 --> 32:05.610
Imperial decree!

32:08.700 --> 32:09.650
Everyone stop!

32:12.080 --> 32:14.920
[Yong'an Palace]

32:19.000 --> 32:20.350
All you servants,

32:20.350 --> 32:21.160
kneel down!

32:22.930 --> 32:23.820
Kneel!

32:28.030 --> 32:29.640
His Majesty's verbal decree:

32:29.640 --> 32:33.910
Princess Ning'an and Demon King Hong Ye
are summoned to the palace.

32:34.090 --> 32:35.560
His Majesty also said,

32:35.710 --> 32:36.970
to show his sincerity,

32:37.200 --> 32:38.270
only I will escort

32:38.270 --> 32:42.110
Your Highness and the Demon King
to the royal study.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.480
Step aside now!

32:48.380 --> 32:52.080
[Yong'an Palace]

32:51.310 --> 32:52.310
Your Highness,

32:52.400 --> 32:53.270
Demon King,

32:54.920 --> 32:55.920
this way, please.

33:23.270 --> 33:25.930
Your Highness and Demon King,
please wait here.

33:33.440 --> 33:34.070
Ning'an.

33:36.000 --> 33:36.590
Ning'an.

33:37.400 --> 33:39.160
You've finally returned.

33:39.440 --> 33:40.040
Are you...

33:40.640 --> 33:41.350
injured?

33:43.110 --> 33:44.770
Were you frightened just now?

33:46.200 --> 33:48.570
I will punish those Feiyu Guards at once!

33:48.720 --> 33:49.350
I am...

33:51.480 --> 33:52.280
fine, Father.

33:52.550 --> 33:54.080
Thank you for your concern.

33:55.510 --> 33:56.570
Rise, please rise.

33:57.550 --> 33:58.480
That's good.

33:59.030 --> 34:00.160
That's good.

34:01.030 --> 34:02.960
During these days when you were away,

34:02.960 --> 34:05.200
I worried about you every day.

34:08.670 --> 34:10.199
Meeting for the first time,

34:10.670 --> 34:12.730
I must seem foolish to the Demon King.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.480
Leave now.

34:20.510 --> 34:21.929
Without my permission,

34:22.280 --> 34:23.280
no one is to enter.

34:25.360 --> 34:28.420
The Demon King and I
have important matters to discuss.

34:29.110 --> 34:29.920
You may go.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.650
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:42.110 --> 34:42.909
You may leave.

34:54.880 --> 34:55.320
I have

34:57.000 --> 34:58.070
no spiritual power

34:59.100 --> 35:00.630
and no magical techniques.

35:00.840 --> 35:03.070
If the Demon King wishes to kill me now,

35:03.800 --> 35:05.130
it would be effortless.

35:06.590 --> 35:09.050
If killing me
could bring peace to the world,

35:09.150 --> 35:10.480
I implore the Demon King

35:11.320 --> 35:12.520
to do so immediately.

35:34.730 --> 35:37.060
Didn't you say you had matters to discuss?

35:38.400 --> 35:39.070
What is it?

35:43.110 --> 35:45.710
If the Demon King
has no intention of killing me,

35:45.710 --> 35:47.440
then let's put aside our guards

35:48.030 --> 35:50.630
and work together
for peace between our races.

35:52.760 --> 35:53.920
I've heard that the Demon King

35:53.920 --> 35:55.580
has feelings for my princess.

35:56.480 --> 35:57.280
Is that true?

36:00.880 --> 36:01.400
Yes.

36:02.360 --> 36:04.270
You have great taste.

36:04.360 --> 36:06.110
My Ning'an is wonderful.

36:07.710 --> 36:09.370
However, in the past, I've had

36:09.800 --> 36:11.670
many regrettable circumstances

36:12.230 --> 36:14.230
and couldn't protect her properly.

36:15.920 --> 36:17.220
It seems that Ning'an

36:18.150 --> 36:20.050
will suffer less in the future.

36:22.440 --> 36:24.670
As your father, I owe you an apology.

36:26.550 --> 36:27.740
Since you were born,

36:27.840 --> 36:29.440
I've rarely visited you.

36:30.110 --> 36:30.710
First,

36:32.470 --> 36:34.600
I feared that remembering your mother

36:34.760 --> 36:35.960
would break my heart.

36:37.110 --> 36:39.150
Second, everyone at court

36:39.150 --> 36:40.560
had their eyes on you.

36:41.150 --> 36:42.230
By staying away,

36:42.840 --> 36:44.710
I was actually protecting you.

36:48.840 --> 36:49.360
Come,

36:50.670 --> 36:52.710
I'll take you to see your mother.

37:03.590 --> 37:05.030
This is your mother.

37:05.920 --> 37:06.740
Back then,

37:07.150 --> 37:08.550
I was still a prince.

37:09.590 --> 37:11.110
I first met your mother

37:12.150 --> 37:14.000
at an academy.

37:14.710 --> 37:16.510
She was standing in the corridor,

37:16.510 --> 37:17.770
playing with a parrot,

37:18.150 --> 37:19.550
teaching it to speak.

37:20.280 --> 37:21.800
With just one glance,

37:22.630 --> 37:25.110
I couldn't take my eyes off her.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.800
After that,

37:28.590 --> 37:30.230
I often went to the academy

37:30.710 --> 37:32.110
to meet your mother.

37:32.590 --> 37:33.630
As time went by,

37:33.880 --> 37:36.290
we promised to grow old together.

37:36.840 --> 37:38.250
I brought your mother

37:38.360 --> 37:39.710
into my residence.

37:41.400 --> 37:43.110
But I gradually discovered

37:43.670 --> 37:44.590
your mother

37:44.950 --> 37:46.740
not only talked to parrots,

37:47.070 --> 37:48.550
but also frequently with cats and dogs,

37:48.550 --> 37:50.410
and even with the fish in our home.

37:51.400 --> 37:52.150
The servants

37:52.150 --> 37:53.760
often saw these animals

37:53.760 --> 37:55.620
communicating with your mother.

37:56.320 --> 37:57.400
She often said

37:58.760 --> 38:00.410
all things have spirits,

38:01.440 --> 38:02.440
and that demons

38:03.030 --> 38:05.590
are manifestations of natural power.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.200
Until one day,

38:08.230 --> 38:09.670
I saw with my own eyes

38:10.510 --> 38:11.960
that your mother's blood

38:12.190 --> 38:14.550
could attract animals from miles around.

38:15.840 --> 38:18.880
It was then I had to accept the fact

38:21.760 --> 38:22.960
that she was a demon.

38:26.510 --> 38:28.230
A human prince's

38:28.760 --> 38:30.360
love affair with a demon

38:30.480 --> 38:32.210
was not accepted in this world.

38:32.920 --> 38:34.980
For me to ascend the throne smoothly,

38:36.070 --> 38:37.350
your mother

38:37.590 --> 38:38.840
moved out of the palace

38:38.840 --> 38:40.640
to live in a separate residence.

38:41.320 --> 38:42.780
After giving birth to you,

38:43.800 --> 38:45.510
she died from complications.

38:46.590 --> 38:49.870
I didn't want to see
Ning'an living away from me,

38:49.920 --> 38:52.320
but the entire court said
she was ill-fated

38:52.360 --> 38:53.480
and must be killed.

38:54.400 --> 38:55.400
I promised them

38:56.280 --> 38:57.940
that when Ning'an came of age,

38:57.960 --> 39:00.960
she would be married off
to a frontier kingdom.

39:01.320 --> 39:05.020
Only then was I able to
keep her in the palace.

39:05.590 --> 39:06.900
Now my daughter

39:07.030 --> 39:08.880
has fallen in love with the Demon King,

39:08.880 --> 39:10.480
it must be fate.

39:11.440 --> 39:13.630
But I don't want the tragedy I experienced

39:13.630 --> 39:15.290
to repeat itself with you two.

39:16.230 --> 39:16.890
Therefore,

39:18.920 --> 39:19.940
I hope you

39:19.960 --> 39:22.840
can openly marry Ning'an.

39:26.840 --> 39:27.550
Demon King,

39:31.400 --> 39:32.400
are you willing?

39:48.820 --> 39:49.710
Of course I am.

39:50.920 --> 39:51.760
Good.

39:52.800 --> 39:53.600
The Demon King

39:53.840 --> 39:55.800
marrying a human princess means

39:55.800 --> 39:57.510
the harmony between our races

39:57.510 --> 39:58.110
will begin

39:58.400 --> 40:00.380
with our royal families.

40:00.800 --> 40:02.060
Isn't this better than

40:02.280 --> 40:03.590
you trying so hard

40:03.710 --> 40:06.550
to gradually heal the divide?

40:06.630 --> 40:08.120
Father, you knew our plan?

40:10.030 --> 40:12.320
It is also exactly what I have in mind.

40:15.760 --> 40:16.550
However,

40:17.760 --> 40:19.360
I have one more request.

40:21.840 --> 40:22.900
I'd like to hear it.

40:23.550 --> 40:24.440
I hope

40:25.840 --> 40:27.510
you can find

40:28.110 --> 40:29.890
the ancient Kunlun Mirror.
